Z||000019||GREENDANO||07-07-99||07:29 PM||||So I was right!!  SSA does stand for sorry it suck anyways.    :)  <br> Sentrifucal is spelled with a "C" plus you spelled the rest of the word wrong.  SFI is sequential fuel injection. I work in a GM dealership, that's what it is.  Plus centrifugal forced induction is a paxton type  belt driven blower, not a turbo as in a turbo 3.8 Grand National motor.<br>  Oh well, I'm just as guilty now by replying to this thread.<br>   Dan-O
